I am unsure what your allegory here is: the molehill is the issue of how Lojban is spelled? And it
is the first thing that people come to in coming to the language?  But why a molehill -- which I
presume means that it is undesirable (or at least is a sign that there are moles, which are
undesirable -- what are the moles here?)?  But, in any case, you have yet to explain why this is a
smear -- from the point of what Lojban is about.  You don't like it but yours is not yet a
developed Lojbanic aesthetic.


